WEBVTT

00:00:00.023 --> 00:00:08.025
A real paid repair, completed September 10. This recording reviews saved evidence; it does not replay signatures or make another purchase.

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:16.052
The owner authorized at most 0.1 test USDC. Actual settlement: 0.000033 test USDC for 131 input and 89 output tokens.

00:00:16.071 --> 00:00:24.076
The baseline charges twice when the same key is retried. First-request and distinct-key tests already pass.

00:00:24.104 --> 00:00:34.107
OpenRouter returned this exact JavaScript. The retry guard returns the original receipt before incrementing charges.

00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:42.133
The unchanged generated output passed all three tests in a network-blocked browser Worker. These are owner-reported tests, not cryptographic attestations.

00:00:42.149 --> 00:00:52.154
The same purchase matched a successful Monad transfer: expected payer, merchant, asset and 33 atomic USDC. Public proof and transaction links are retained.
